{"id":"wb-8-359","name":"汝宁石桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"汝宁石桥","text":"汝宁石桥（又称汝河石桥）是位于河南省汝南县汝河上的两座明代石桥，分别为县城东关的济民桥和北关的宏济桥。1986年11月被公布为第二批河南省文物保护单位，2019年10月被公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%9D%E5%AE%81%E7%9F%B3%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":91638410,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91638410","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f6a0646890c979ab2847cfad.jpg","title":"20251002_Jimin_Bridge_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20251002_Jimin_Bridge_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2a/20251002_Jimin_Bridge_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​汝南 济民桥（东汝河石桥）","width":320,"height":213}}